  "content": "<p>Этот ресурсный пакет призван обеспечить английский перевод содержания мода <strong>CAPS_Awim`s Tactical Equipment.</strong><br>В стандартном моде английский перевод на самом деле выполнен на русском языке, что затрудняет понимание, поиск предметов и их крафт.</p><p>⚠️ Этот ресурсный пакет требует мода <strong>\"CAPS_Awim`s Tactical Equipment\"</strong>.<br><strong>⚠️</strong> Он доступен на Modrinth.</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Мой контент:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Моды:<br></em><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sbw-remoove-recipe-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] Удалить рецепт оружия</a>&nbsp;<em> </em><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-remoove-recipe-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[</a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-remoove-recipe-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TACZ] Удалить рецепт оружия</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vpb-remoove-recipe-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[VPB] Удалить рецепт оружия</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Список совместимости датапаков с броней для SBW:</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-apocalypse-now-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apocalypse Now</a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-caps-awins-armor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CAPS Awin's</a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-chovys-apocalypse-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chovy's Apocalypse</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-combat-gear-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Gear</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-extinction-z-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extinction Z</a></strong>&nbsp; <strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-lesraisins-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LesRaisins Armor</a></strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-marbleds-arsenal-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marbled's Arsenal</a>&nbsp; </strong><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-miklos-military-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Miklos' Military Armor</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-military-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Military Armor</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-nato-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NATO Armor</a>&nbsp; </strong><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-protective-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Protective Armor</a>&nbsp; </strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-russian-army-uniforms-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Форма российской армии</a>&nbsp; </strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-survival-instinct-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Инстинкт выживания</strong></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-tactical-stuff-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Тактические принадлежности</strong></a> <strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-vanilla-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ванильная броня</a></strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-warborn-resurgence-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Варборн Резуррекшн</a>&nbsp; </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-zombie-extreme-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Зомби Экстрим</a>&nbsp;</strong><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-zombie-survival-kit-armor-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Зомби Набор для выживания</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Модификация оружия в Datapack:</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/sbw-bocek-nerf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] Боцек Нерф</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Ресурспак:</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/apocalypse-gui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apocalypse Gui</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/caps-awins-english\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caps Awin's English</a></strong>&nbsp; <br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Курсор для Minecraft:</span> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cursor-black-mittens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Чёрный</a> / <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cursor-dark-green-mittens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Тёмно-зелёный</a> / <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cursor-green-mittens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Зелёный</a> / <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cursor-pink-mittens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Розовый</a> / <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cursor-red-mittens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Красный</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
